---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Advisory for Investors"
  description="ESG risk assessment, due diligence and traceability verification for capital entering ASM-adjacent and frontier-market mining assets."
>
  <section class="section service-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/what-we-do">&larr; What We Do</a></p>
      <h1 class="reveal">05 &middot; Advisory for Investors</h1>
      <p class="lede reveal">
        Frontier-market mining assets carry real opportunity and real risk,
        often intertwined with artisanal mining activity investors don&rsquo;t
        fully see from a distance. We help you see both clearly before you
        commit.
      </p>

      <div class="body-grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <h2>What this covers</h2>
          <p>
            ESG and human rights risk assessments across a mine site or
            supply chain, due diligence on sourcing claims, and evaluation
            of an operation&rsquo;s readiness for formal investment. Our
            blockchain-based traceability approach verifies origin and
            chain of custody from mine to market.
          </p>
          <p>
            We can also assess a prospective mining partner directly,
            whether ASM or large-scale: governance, safety practice,
            community relationships, ASM interface risk, and environmental
            exposure, before capital is committed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <h2>How we work</h2>
          <p>
            Our assessments draw on direct experience running an ASM
            operation ourselves, which shapes what we look for and how we
            weigh it. Findings are documented clearly enough to support an
            investment committee&rsquo;s decision process.
          </p>
          <p>
            Where gaps exist, we can also advise the mining partner
            directly on closing them, so a promising opportunity has a
            practical path to bankability.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="pill-btn" href="/contact">Talk to us about a project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .body-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--gap);
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .cta-row {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .body-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
